OL,3,GNEWSAReform Wales leader backs Senedd
OL,4,Amember who said white people being
OL,5,Areplaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday the Senedd's Presiding
OL,8,FOfficer Huw Irranca-Davies said
OL,9,FMartin's remarks were "unnecessarily
OL,10,Fprovocative and deliberately
OL,11,Foffensive".
OL,13,FIn a statement on social media on
OL,14,FWednesday, Jenner said: "Whatever your
OL,15,Fpolitical views, nobody elected to the
OL,16,FSenedd should be silenced simply
OL,17,Fbecause others disagree with what they
OL,18,Fhave to say."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
